{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Shuttah — the camera-boss of the Island Board\nCh.3 miniboss: a face with a film-reel mouth and eyes on its hands. Its photos are, by design, black and white — 'gray memories'.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Kris** Uses the Camera to defeat/photograph it on the Island Board — its recruit is called 'Copy'.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Gaster** A True Lab-style curtain before the fight; same gray/monochrome thematic field as the Followers and the Vessel.","x":390,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Kris's Envy (green/gray)** Its photos are gray until the group restores its color — same visual code as Kris/Asriel's room.","x":-130,"y":398,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**TV World / Green Room** Appears behind a curtain next to the Green Room; remembers the time before the Dark Fountain and knows about the Forgotten Island.","x":-650,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shuttah_battle_idle.gif","x":-190,"y":-380,"width":194,"height":260},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-130,"y":-748,"width":240,"height":146},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster.png","x":390,"y":-280,"width":70,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/shuttah_black_and_white.jpg","x":-94,"y":748,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Green_Room_location_Ramb's_bar.png","x":-960,"y":-80,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s2","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_gaster_envidia","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_kris_greenroom","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_envidia_greenroom","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"}]}